# kubectl Commands Learned

Create Deployment

```bash
kubectl apply -f nginx-deployment.yaml
```

View Deployment

```bash
kubectl get deployments
```

Short form

```bash
kubectl get deploy
```

View Pods

```bash
kubectl get pods
```

Delete Deployment

```bash
kubectl delete deployment nginx-deployment
```

Delete Pod

```bash
kubectl delete pod <pod-name>
```

View ReplicaSets

```bash
kubectl get rs
```

or

```bash
kubectl get replicasets
```

