# kubectl get deployments Output

Example:

```text
NAME               READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
nginx-deployment   3/3     3            3           11s
```

READY

Pods ready / Desired Pods

Example:

```
3/3
```

UP-TO-DATE

Pods running the latest Deployment specification.

AVAILABLE

Pods available to serve traffic.

AGE

Time since Deployment was created.

